Ask github.com for the newest release: exit 0 when up to date, 10 when a newer version is available

Usage: zaun update check [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json        Machine-readable output
  -v, --verbose...  Increase log verbosity (-v debug, -vv trace)
  -h, --help        Print help
